            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Yes, full info appear in the same place where previously there was only file path. I have checked laststatus and its value does not change. I will try removing most of my plugins with no success so far.\r\n\r\nThe screenshots bellow are taken with laststatus = 2.\r\n\r\nHere the statusline is ok:\r\n![before](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18408832/175162458-1c1a1288-31bc-459c-8a70-425e7b18c7e8.png)\r\n\r\nThis is after moving to the upper split (statusline shows as inactive):\r\n![after](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18408832/175162501-a4ff2d8b-bb34-4719-a08c-29994dc6cdca.png)\r\n\r\nThis is after executing :bnext. The statusline is ok\r\n![bnext](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/18408832/175162554-0541b10c-6536-4026-b3e0-af210097529d.png)\r\n\r\nThese are my nvim config files:\r\n[nvimrc.zip](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/files/8962153/nvimrc.zip)",
